/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:460:### 4.2 The module closure walker\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:661:### 4.3 The staged load\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:788:## 5. Publication\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:790:### 5.1 Rows, every round (owner decision 1)\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:829:### 5.2 A module closure\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:936:### 5.3 Deriving a module from indexed code (R9)\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:997:### 5.4 Announcing\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1005:### 5.5 Replication: the ledger, the backlog, repair and the result\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1012:#### 5.5.1 The publication ledger\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1082:#### 5.5.2 The backlog\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1141:#### 5.5.3 The result and the events\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1274:#### 5.5.4 Automatic repair (owner decision 5: \"Automatic retry while open\")\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1338:#### 5.5.5 Cancellation\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1425:#### 5.5.6 What the result means for the index and for readers\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1445:## 6. Names: envelopes, proofs, keys\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1447:### 6.1 The envelope\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1474:### 6.2 The principal id and key encoding\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1488:### 6.3 The proof and the signed bytes\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1526:### 6.4 `yin.vm.linker.sign`\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1609:### 6.5 The key file (owner decision 2)\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1716:### 6.6 Republishing a name\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1725:## 7. Resolution\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1727:### 7.1 Authority is the reader's composition\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1741:### 7.2 The snapshot set\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1759:### 7.3 The fold\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1803:### 7.4 Transitive requires\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:1873:### 7.5 Admission: the linker's trust question\n