antlr.md:2440:#### 8.5.5 Float addresses\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:2637:#### 8.5.6 Imports, the linked prelude, and the frontend catalog (phase C4)\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3278:### 8.6 Object-oriented and web: PHP, mixed text and ordered maps\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3309:### 8.7 Prototype: JavaScript, lexical environments and jobs\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3336:### 8.8 Functional: Clojure and its hosts\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3346:### 8.9 Systems: Go, Rust, C, and further extensions\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3376:### 8.10 Cross-language calls\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3388:### 8.11 Mutable objects and collections over cells\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3550:## 9. Standard library and FFI architecture\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3560:### 9.1 The four-layer model\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3586:### 9.2 Layer 1: pure modules\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3597:### 9.3 Layer 2: language intrinsics and preludes\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3630:### 9.4 Layer 3: object system desugaring\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3653:### 9.5 Layer 4: system I/O and effects\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3677:### 9.6 Module distribution\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3688:## 10. Diagnostics and error reporting\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3695:### 10.1 Boundary policy\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3715:### 10.2 Qualified outcome maps\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3729:### 10.3 Proposed diagnostic record\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3751:### 10.4 Diagnostic datoms on the stream\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3765:## 11. Determinism and isolation\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3822:## 12. Phased roadmap\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3824:### Phase 0: SPI, ANTLR boundary, and stream pipeline\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3851:### Phase 1: Dynamic pilot, Python followed by JavaScript\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3899:### Phase 2: Java static and class-based pilot\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3919:### Phase 3: PHP web and associative-array pilot\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3937:### Phase 4: Language extension SDK and documentation (open SPI)\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3959:### Phase 5: Multi-host verification and integration benchmarks\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3988:## 13. Verification laws\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3990:### 13.1 Laws\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4022:### 13.2 SPI compliance test matrix\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4056:### 13.3 Completion criteria\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
